{"seq":3,"slug":"visible-spectrum","title":"可见光谱与色彩物理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/optics-basics/light-physics/visible-spectrum","wordCount":2051,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"可见光谱与色彩物理\">可见光谱与色彩物理</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>可见光谱是电磁波谱中人眼能感知的极窄波段——仅占整个电磁波谱的不到万亿分之一，却承载了人类视觉世界的全部色彩信息。对于摄影师而言，理解可见光谱的物理特性，是掌握色彩还原、白平衡校正与色彩管理的必要前提。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;380nm&lt;br/&gt;Violet&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;450nm&lt;br/&gt;Blue&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;495nm&lt;br/&gt;Cyan&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;520nm&lt;br/&gt;Green&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;570nm&lt;br/&gt;Yellow&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;590nm&lt;br/&gt;Orange&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;620nm&lt;br/&gt;Red&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;780nm&lt;br/&gt;Deep Red&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"380nm&lt;br/&gt;Violet\"] --&gt; B[\"450nm&lt;br/&gt;Blue\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"495nm&lt;br/&gt;Cyan\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"520nm&lt;br/&gt;Green\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"570nm&lt;br/&gt;Yellow\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"590nm&lt;br/&gt;Orange\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"620nm&lt;br/&gt;Red\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"780nm&lt;br/&gt;Deep Red\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>色彩物理的关键在于把&quot;颜色&quot;从物理量与感知之间区分清楚：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可见光窗口</strong>：人眼响应约 380–780 nm，波长对应色彩感知，短波光子能量约为长波的两倍。</li>\n<li><strong>三色视觉</strong>：S/M/L 三种视锥细胞的响应曲线高度重叠，光视效能函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(\\lambda)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 在 555 nm 处取峰值 1.0。</li>\n<li><strong>色温与黑体辐射</strong>：普朗克定律与维恩位移定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{max} = b/T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 把光源光谱与色温联系起来，CCT 描述非黑体光源的等效温度。</li>\n<li><strong>显色性</strong>：CRI 用 8（+6）个色样评价光源，TM-30 则以 99 个色样给出保真度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与色域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>色度学</strong>：CIE 1931 XYZ 用色度坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x, y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 数学化地表示颜色，同色异谱说明&quot;颜色是感知，不是物理量&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>光与物质相互作用</strong>：吸收/反射/透射的能量分配决定了物体颜色，荧光现象会把 UV 转化为可见光并可能超出 sRGB 色域。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"可见光的波长范围与颜色\">可见光的波长范围与颜色</h2><h3 id=\"光谱色彩对应关系\">光谱色彩对应关系</h3><p>人眼对电磁辐射的敏感范围约为 380–780 nm。不同波长对应不同的色彩感知：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>波长范围 (nm)</th>\n<th>颜色</th>\n<th>频率范围 (THz)</th>\n<th>光子能量 (eV)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>380–450</td>\n<td>紫色 (Violet)</td>\n<td>668–789</td>\n<td>2.76–3.26</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>450–495</td>\n<td>蓝色 (Blue)</td>\n<td>606–668</td>\n<td>2.51–2.76</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>495–520</td>\n<td>青色 (Cyan)</td>\n<td>577–606</td>\n<td>2.38–2.51</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>520–570</td>\n<td>绿色 (Green)</td>\n<td>526–577</td>\n<td>2.18–2.38</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>570–590</td>\n<td>黄色 (Yellow)</td>\n<td>508–526</td>\n<td>2.10–2.18</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>590–620</td>\n<td>橙色 (Orange)</td>\n<td>484–508</td>\n<td>2.00–2.10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>620–780</td>\n<td>红色 (Red)</td>\n<td>384–484</td>\n<td>1.59–2.00</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>紫光的光子能量约为红光的 2 倍——这一差异在光化学反应（如胶片曝光）和传感器量子效率曲线中都有直接体现。</p>\n<h3 id=\"光谱色与非光谱色\">光谱色与非光谱色</h3><p>光谱上每个波长对应一种&quot;纯色&quot;（光谱色），但人眼感知到的许多颜色在光谱上并不存在：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>品红/洋红 (Magenta)</strong>：不存在对应的单一波长，是红光与蓝光同时刺激的结果</li>\n<li><strong>白色</strong>：全部可见波长的均匀混合</li>\n<li><strong>棕色、粉色</strong>：特定光谱分布的感知结果</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这一事实揭示了一个关键原则：<strong>颜色是感知，不是物理量</strong>。同样的色彩感知可以由完全不同的光谱分布产生——这就是同色异谱（Metamerism）现象。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"人眼的光谱响应\">人眼的光谱响应</h2><h3 id=\"视锥细胞与三色理论\">视锥细胞与三色理论</h3><p>人眼视网膜上有三种视锥细胞（Cone cells），分别对不同波段最敏感：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>视锥类型</th>\n<th>峰值波长</th>\n<th>敏感范围</th>\n<th>对应色觉</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>S (Short)</td>\n<td>~420 nm</td>\n<td>380–540 nm</td>\n<td>蓝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>M (Medium)</td>\n<td>~534 nm</td>\n<td>440–670 nm</td>\n<td>绿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L (Long)</td>\n<td>~564 nm</td>\n<td>500–700 nm</td>\n<td>红</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三种视锥的响应曲线高度重叠——特别是 M 和 L 视锥。这意味着人眼对黄-绿光的辨色能力最强（M/L 响应差异大），而对深红色的波长辨别能力较弱。</p>\n<h3 id=\"光视效能函数-v-lambda\">光视效能函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(\\lambda)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></h3><p>CIE 1924 定义的明视觉光视效能函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(\\lambda)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 描述了人眼在正常照明下对不同波长的相对灵敏度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>380</mn><mtext> nm</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1.0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>555</mn><mtext> nm (peak)</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>0</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>780</mn><mtext> nm</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(\\lambda) = \\begin{cases} 0 &amp; \\lambda &lt; 380 \\text{ nm} \\\\ 1.0 &amp; \\lambda = 555 \\text{ nm (peak)} \\\\ 0 &amp; \\lambda &gt; 780 \\text{ nm} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">380</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> nm</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">555</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> nm (peak)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">780</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> nm</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(\\lambda)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的实际意义：相同辐射功率的 555 nm 绿光和 680 nm 红光，前者看起来亮约 100 倍。这解释了为什么绿色通道在 Bayer 阵列中占据 50% 的像素——它对亮度信息的贡献最大。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"光谱能量分布与色温\">光谱能量分布与色温</h2><h3 id=\"黑体辐射与普朗克定律\">黑体辐射与普朗克定律</h3><p>理想黑体在温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 时的光谱辐射功率密度由普朗克定律给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(\\lambda, T) = \\frac{2hc^2}{\\lambda^5} \\cdot \\frac{1}{e^{hc/(\\lambda k_B T)} - 1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1088em;vertical-align:-0.7873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.296em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.814em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7873em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为玻尔兹曼常数。随着温度升高，辐射峰值向短波方向移动（维恩位移定律）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>T</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.898</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> m⋅K</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{max} = \\frac{b}{T}, \\quad b = 2.898 \\times 10^{-3} \\text{ m·K}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.898</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> m⋅K</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>色温 (K)</th>\n<th>峰值波长 (nm)</th>\n<th>视觉颜色</th>\n<th>典型光源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1800</td>\n<td>1610</td>\n<td>暖橙</td>\n<td>烛光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2700</td>\n<td>1073</td>\n<td>暖黄</td>\n<td>白炽灯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4000</td>\n<td>725</td>\n<td>中性白</td>\n<td>荧光灯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5500</td>\n<td>527</td>\n<td>日光白</td>\n<td>正午日光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6500</td>\n<td>446</td>\n<td>冷白</td>\n<td>阴天/D65标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10000</td>\n<td>290</td>\n<td>蓝白</td>\n<td>蔚蓝天空</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph Color Temperature Scale&#10;        A[&quot;1800K Candle&lt;br/&gt;Warm Orange&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;2700K Tungsten&lt;br/&gt;Warm Yellow&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; C[&quot;4000K Fluorescent&lt;br/&gt;Neutral&quot;]&#10;        C --&gt; D[&quot;5500K Daylight&lt;br/&gt;White&quot;]&#10;        D --&gt; E[&quot;6500K Overcast&lt;br/&gt;Cool&quot;]&#10;        E --&gt; F[&quot;10000K Blue Sky&lt;br/&gt;Cold Blue&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph Color Temperature Scale\n        A[\"1800K Candle&lt;br/&gt;Warm Orange\"] --&gt; B[\"2700K Tungsten&lt;br/&gt;Warm Yellow\"]\n        B --&gt; C[\"4000K Fluorescent&lt;br/&gt;Neutral\"]\n        C --&gt; D[\"5500K Daylight&lt;br/&gt;White\"]\n        D --&gt; E[\"6500K Overcast&lt;br/&gt;Cool\"]\n        E --&gt; F[\"10000K Blue Sky&lt;br/&gt;Cold Blue\"]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"相关色温-cct\">相关色温 (CCT)</h3><p>许多实际光源（如 LED、荧光灯）的光谱不符合黑体辐射，但可以找到一个视觉上最接近的黑体温度——这就是相关色温。CCT 相同的光源可能具有完全不同的光谱形状，导致不同的显色效果。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"显色性与光谱完整度\">显色性与光谱完整度</h2><h3 id=\"显色指数-cri\">显色指数 (CRI)</h3><p>CRI 评价光源照射下物体颜色与参考光源（黑体或 D65）下的一致程度，满分 100：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CRI 范围</th>\n<th>评价</th>\n<th>典型光源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>95–100</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>白炽灯、高 CRI LED</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>80–95</td>\n<td>良好</td>\n<td>三基色荧光灯、一般 LED</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>60–80</td>\n<td>一般</td>\n<td>普通荧光灯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&lt; 60</td>\n<td>较差</td>\n<td>钠灯、汞灯</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对于摄影，CRI &gt; 90 的光源是准确色彩还原的基本要求。低 CRI 光源下拍摄的照片，即使白平衡正确，色彩也可能出现偏差——因为光谱中缺少某些波段的能量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"tm-30-评价体系\">TM-30 评价体系</h3><p>CRI 的局限在于只用 8（+6）个测试色样，且以均匀色空间计算偏差。IES TM-30（2018 修订版）采用 99 个色样，同时给出保真度指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和色域指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，能更全面地描述光源的色彩再现特性。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"cie-色度图-色彩的数学表示\">CIE 色度图——色彩的数学表示</h2><h3 id=\"cie-1931-xyz-色彩空间\">CIE 1931 XYZ 色彩空间</h3><p>1931 年，CIE（国际照明委员会）通过颜色匹配实验建立了 XYZ 色彩空间。任何光源的颜色可以用色度坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x, y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 表示：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>X</mi><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Z</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Z</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x = \\frac{X}{X+Y+Z}, \\quad y = \\frac{Y}{X+Y+Z}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>色度图的边界（马蹄形曲线）对应纯光谱色，内部区域代表混合色。连接边界两端（380 nm 和 780 nm）的直线称为&quot;紫色线&quot;——品红色位于此线上。</p>\n<h3 id=\"色度图在摄影中的意义\">色度图在摄影中的意义</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>色彩空间边界</strong>：sRGB、Adobe RGB、DCI-P3 等色彩空间在色度图上是三角形区域</li>\n<li><strong>白点位置</strong>：D65（x=0.3127, y=0.3290）是多数显示标准的参考白点</li>\n<li><strong>色温轨迹</strong>：普朗克轨迹在色度图上是一条曲线，色温从低到高沿此曲线移动</li>\n<li><strong>同色异谱检测</strong>：光谱不同但色度坐标相同的光源在某些照明下会&quot;分裂&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"光与物质的相互作用\">光与物质的相互作用</h2><h3 id=\"吸收-反射与透射\">吸收、反射与透射</h3><p>当光照射到物体表面时，能量分配遵循：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Phi_{incident} = \\Phi_{reflected} + \\Phi_{absorbed} + \\Phi_{transmitted}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Φ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Φ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Φ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">sor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Φ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>物体的&quot;颜色&quot;是其反射光谱决定的——红色苹果吸收了短波光，反射了长波（红色）光。</p>\n<h3 id=\"荧光与磷光\">荧光与磷光</h3><p>某些物质吸收短波光后发出长波光——这就是荧光（Fluorescence）。荧光物质在紫外灯下&quot;发光&quot;的原因是将不可见的 UV 光转化为了可见光。这一现象在摄影中的影响：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>某些白色衣物含有荧光增白剂，在日光下异常&quot;亮白&quot;</li>\n<li>部分颜料具有荧光特性，在特定光源下色彩失真</li>\n<li>荧光材料可能超出 sRGB 色域，导致拍摄时出现色彩裁切</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"本章小结\">本章小结</h2><p>可见光谱虽仅是电磁波谱的极微小片段，却是摄影色彩科学的全部舞台。从人眼三色视觉到 CIE 色度学，从黑体辐射到显色性评价，本文建立了色彩的物理基础。这些知识将直接支撑后续章节中白平衡、色彩空间、色彩管理等实践性更强的主题。记住：<strong>颜色的本质是光谱与人眼响应的卷积结果</strong>——这一认知将贯穿整个色彩科学体系。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可见光谱与色彩物理","id":"可见光谱与色彩物理"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"可见光的波长范围与颜色","id":"可见光的波长范围与颜色"},{"level":3,"text":"光谱色彩对应关系","id":"光谱色彩对应关系"},{"level":3,"text":"光谱色与非光谱色","id":"光谱色与非光谱色"},{"level":2,"text":"人眼的光谱响应","id":"人眼的光谱响应"},{"level":3,"text":"视锥细胞与三色理论","id":"视锥细胞与三色理论"},{"level":3,"text":"光视效能函数 V(\\lambda)","id":"光视效能函数-v-lambda"},{"level":2,"text":"光谱能量分布与色温","id":"光谱能量分布与色温"},{"level":3,"text":"黑体辐射与普朗克定律","id":"黑体辐射与普朗克定律"},{"level":3,"text":"相关色温 (CCT)","id":"相关色温-cct"},{"level":2,"text":"显色性与光谱完整度","id":"显色性与光谱完整度"},{"level":3,"text":"显色指数 (CRI)","id":"显色指数-cri"},{"level":3,"text":"TM-30 评价体系","id":"tm-30-评价体系"},{"level":2,"text":"CIE 色度图——色彩的数学表示","id":"cie-色度图-色彩的数学表示"},{"level":3,"text":"CIE 1931 XYZ 色彩空间","id":"cie-1931-xyz-色彩空间"},{"level":3,"text":"色度图在摄影中的意义","id":"色度图在摄影中的意义"},{"level":2,"text":"光与物质的相互作用","id":"光与物质的相互作用"},{"level":3,"text":"吸收、反射与透射","id":"吸收-反射与透射"},{"level":3,"text":"荧光与磷光","id":"荧光与磷光"},{"level":2,"text":"本章小结","id":"本章小结"}],"prev":{"title":"波粒二象性与量子光学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/optics-basics/light-physics/wave-particle-duality"},"next":{"title":"透镜成像原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/optics-basics/lens-optics/lens-imaging"}}